HTTPRoutes for SeaweedFS (S3 API + admin browser UI).

Hostnames (subdomain mode):
  - s3.<base_domain_name>          → seaweedfs-s3:8333
  - seaweedfs.<base_domain_name>   → seaweedfs-admin:23646

Parent refs are resolved in tasks/s3_listener_section.yaml (_edp_s3_parent,
_edp_admin_parent). The S3 route binds whichever listener claims its hostname: the
dedicated S3 listener when the core installer created one for ONTAP (it claims
s3.<base_domain_name> exactly and carries the SigV4 path policy), else EDP's own
ListenerSet when the platform gateway accepts ListenerSets, else the legacy wildcard
'*.<base_domain_name>' listener; the apex listener in path mode. The admin route
follows the same rule without the dedicated listener.

No gateway auth on either route - S3 clients use SigV4, the admin UI has its own
session layer. The exemptions are applied by tasks/seaweedfs.yaml through the
platform's provider-neutral route_auth_exempt.yaml.
#}
---
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: HTTPRoute
metadata:
  name: seaweedfs-s3-route
  namespace: {{ edp_seaweedfs_namespace }}
  labels:
    app.kubernetes.io/name: seaweedfs-s3
    app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: ansible
spec:
  parentRefs:
    - {{ _edp_s3_parent | to_json }}
  hostnames:
    - "{{ _edp_s3_host }}"
  rules:
    - matches:
        - path:
            type: PathPrefix
{% if routing_mode | default('subdomain') == 'path' %}
            value: {{ _edp_s3_prefix }}
      filters:
        - type: URLRewrite
          urlRewrite:
            path:
              type: ReplacePrefixMatch
              replacePrefixMatch: /
{% else %}
            value: /
{% endif %}
      timeouts:
        request: 3600s
        backendRequest: 3600s
      backendRefs:
        - name: seaweedfs-s3
          port: 8333
---
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: HTTPRoute
metadata:
  name: seaweedfs-admin-route
  namespace: {{ edp_seaweedfs_namespace }}
  labels:
    app.kubernetes.io/name: seaweedfs-admin
    app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: ansible
spec:
  parentRefs:
    - {{ _edp_admin_parent | to_json }}
  hostnames:
{% if routing_mode | default('subdomain') == 'path' %}
    - "{{ base_domain_name }}"
{% else %}
    - "{{ _edp_admin_host }}"
{% endif %}
  rules:
    - matches:
        - path:
            type: PathPrefix
{% if routing_mode | default('subdomain') == 'path' %}
            value: {{ _edp_seaweedfs_prefix }}
{% else %}
            value: /
{% endif %}
      backendRefs:
        - name: seaweedfs-admin
          port: 23646
